    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/76cdba3201942e4b8be0f398566afdaa.poster.avif?t=1728699973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/76cdba3201942e4b8be0f398566afdaa.webm?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/76cdba3201942e4b8be0f398566afdaa.mp4?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><br>NOUMISO JOURNEY<br>Cute brain, go on a trip! <br><br><i>\u2500 A boy named Monpuchi was killed by a murderer and came back to life on Halloween.<br>But his brain(NOUMISO) has been stolen!? </i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monpuchi's brain is incredibly delicious.</h2>The nutrient-rich brain is a hit among monsters!<br><br>Come on, hurry up, we have to get the brains back before they eat them all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/e0ca4b11e589ade1c3deae562ac1dbc9.poster.avif?t=1728699973\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/e0ca4b11e589ade1c3deae562ac1dbc9.apng?t=1728699973\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Scene Collection System</h2><br>In the murderer's mansion, danger abounds!<br>Stabbings, electrocutions, poisonings, and even exsanguinations, etc.<br>From terrifying demises to bizarre endings,<br><strong>collect over 20 different death scenes!</strong><br><br><i>Contains elements of cartoonish violence and horror. </i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/8d4cc0a7277a17f362e0e928ef4187da.poster.avif?t=1728699973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/8d4cc0a7277a17f362e0e928ef4187da.webm?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/8d4cc0a7277a17f362e0e928ef4187da.mp4?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for these people!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Want to enjoy an interesting horror game.<br></li><li>Want to progress smoothly with casual difficulty.<br></li><li>Want to be thrown into a world with no ethics.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/c5025b4fed3c3a292d88bd150ced1e31.poster.avif?t=1728699973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/c5025b4fed3c3a292d88bd150ced1e31.webm?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/c5025b4fed3c3a292d88bd150ced1e31.mp4?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/7174bc0d9139c74edd270dd8ac9bcefc.poster.avif?t=1728699973\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/7174bc0d9139c74edd270dd8ac9bcefc.webm?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556060/extras/7174bc0d9139c74edd270dd8ac9bcefc.mp4?t=1728699973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s